{"success":true,"code":"000","message":null,"data":{"totalAmount":2,"totalPageCount":1,"pageNum":0,"itemCount":2,"content":[{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a09a9aa9dc5a833d89e4","chatId":"8cc2863ef5fe4a61b34e330039456576","sessionId":null,"userId":98156,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"role","content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[{"content":"```json\n{\n  \"answer_q1\": \"E\",\n  \"answer_q2\": \"A\"\n}\n```","options":null,"isShow":true,"label":"","evaluate":"","takingTime":5679,"promptTokens":1526,"completionTokens":201,"responseSource":"agent:llm","censorData":{"labels":null,"words":null},"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:50"}],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":3,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003591587387030362,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a09a9aa9dc5a833d89e3","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482330343,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null},{"pageNum":0,"pageSize":0,"id":"6af5a09a9aa9dc5a833d89e3","chatId":"8cc2863ef5fe4a61b34e330039456576","sessionId":null,"userId":98156,"orgId":3721,"botId":1030,"isGreeting":false,"role":"user","content":"# 说明\n在这个任务中，你会面临一个场景、一个问题和多个选项。\n仔细分析场景，并从相关人员的角度进行思考。\n然后，选择最能反映他们的观点或情绪反应的选项。\n\n# 输出\n\n只提供一个正确的答案。 不要提供任何额外的信息或解释。 回复应采用以下JSON格式：\n\n```json\n    {\n    \"answer_q1\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题1>\",\n\"answer_q2\": \"<用相应的字母进行回答问题2>\"\n\n    }\n``` \n    \n\n## 场景\n多瑞在尝试制作蜜糖果仁千层酥， 当她从烤箱拿出来时， 发现千层酥制作失败了，面层不酥脆，内馅也炸出到盘子上。那时，她的女儿刚回到家，看到她母亲制作的新鲜但失败了的蜜糖果仁千层酥。她尝了一口，给母亲竖起一个大拇指。\n\n## 问题 1\n在这种情况下，多瑞最终会感受到什么情绪？\n\n## 问题 1 的选项\nA) 惊喜\nB) 生气\nC) 尴尬\nD) 绝望\nE) 自豪\nF) 失望\n\n## 问题 2\n多瑞为什么会在这种情况下感受到这些情绪？\n\n## 问题 2 的选项\nA) 她的女儿想鼓励她，虽然不喜欢这次做的巴克拉瓦\nB) 尽管她不喜欢自己做的千层酥，她还是对女儿很喜欢它很惊喜\nC) 巴克拉瓦并未被毁掉\nD) 她的女儿刚刚回到家","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.003591587387030362,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af5a09a9aa9dc5a833d89e4","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794482330340,"createTime":"2026-11-12 19:18:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"1076b5e5862f400fa9a077f6796fe6d9"}